  ],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "ASID-1M",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tASID-1M: Attribute-Structured and Quality-Verified Audiovisual Instructions\n\t\n\n[\ud83c\udfe0 Homepage] [\ud83d\udcd6 Arxiv Paper] [\ud83e\udd17 Models & Datasets] [\ud83d\udcbb Code]\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tIntroduction\n\t\n\nWe introduce ASID-1M, a large-scale audiovisual instruction dataset built to support universal video understanding with fine-grained, controllable supervision.\nMost existing video-instruction data represents complex audiovisual content as a single, monolithic caption. This often leads to incomplete coverage (missing audio\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AudioVisual-Caption/ASID-1M.",
  "alternateName": [
    "AudioVisual-Caption/ASID-1M",
    "ASID-1M"
  ],
